      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KENZIE KID (1) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing sixth (26.70) at this track latest. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Has ability and can bounce back. ASTON HAMILTON (6) has a strong record here with four wins and two placings from 10 starts. Hit the frame latest (23.58) when third at this track in a Grade 5. Looks a key chance on best figures. SOMERTON WILLOW (3) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split, weakening late to finish a 2.75 lengths fourth (19.79) over 350m at Healesville. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from seven starts. Can do much better this time. SMOOTH TIGER (2) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
